class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hello Peter. I'm just dropping by to see when you're free. I see you responded to Janet's request to write the proposal to Farmani.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>r: Oh hi Miranda. Hey, would you mind waiting a minute? I'm just talking on the phone with my mother. You know she's hoping I can take the week off."}, {"time": "18100", "image": "engenn6le14ob09re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. Well, tell her I hope she's well and that your workmates are glad you can keep up with some pressing responsibilities.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I will. But say, would you be available to meet after lunch? I'd like some time to order my thoughts.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Actually, I'd like to meet earlier. I need to provide you with some information for those thoughts you plan to order. I think it's rather crucial you know something about my meeting with Farmani.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How soon are you thinking?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Well, I'm thinking about now. I'm having a meeting with Fernando at 10:30.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How much time will you need?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: With Ferdinand, an hour. With you, 30 minutes."}, {"time": "58200", "image": "engenn6le14ob09re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Alright then, would you be available for a coffee at 11:30?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Fine. If you need to talk with me before then, feel free to come by my office. I'm scheduling my meeting with Greta now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Greta? Oh, mom. I have to go. Miranda? I'll come now."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}